    "id": "ee715b18ac9dfe751696eec7",
    "path": "datafusion_sql::unparser::dialect::SnowflakeDialect",
    "name": "SnowflakeDialect",
    "owner": null,
    "crate": "datafusion-sql",
    "version": "55.1.0",
    "kind": "struct",
    "signature": "struct SnowflakeDialect",
    "docs": "Dialect for Snowflake SQL.\n\nKey differences from the default dialect:\n- Uses double-quote identifier quoting\n- Supports `NULLS FIRST`/`NULLS LAST` in `ORDER BY`\n- Does not support empty select lists (`SELECT FROM t`)\n- Does not support column aliases in table alias definitions\n  (Snowflake accepts the syntax but silently ignores the renames in join contexts)\n- Unparses `UNNEST` plans as `LATERAL FLATTEN(INPUT => expr, ...)`",
